<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:37:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>伊朗首席谈判代表警告称，美国为回应对军舰的袭击企图而袭击油轮，伊朗的报复行动将“更快、更猛烈、更痛苦”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/iran-faster-heavier-painful-oil-tankers-attack-attempt-warships/</link><description>穆罕默德·巴格尔·卡利巴夫表示，“比例反应”的时代已经结束。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2159414346-e1788702269963.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 13:49:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/iran-faster-heavier-painful-oil-tankers-attack-attempt-warships/</guid></item><item><title>美国特使维特科夫和库什纳抵达基辅，与普京会谈未能取得突破，双方继续交火</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/us-envoys-witkoff-kushner-ukraine-talks-putin-russia/</link><description>普京和泽连斯基同意在会谈期间暂停对对方首都的袭击。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26249429753138-e1788701714921.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 13:41:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/us-envoys-witkoff-kushner-ukraine-talks-putin-russia/</guid></item><item><title>就像杰米戴蒙一样，AT&amp;amp;T 首席执行官表示，如果你参加会议，你需要做好准备——他“渴望”那些不只是坐下来观察的人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/att-ceo-john-stankey-meeting-etiquette-show-up-prepared-crave-productivity-like-jpmorgan-ceo-jamie-dimon/</link><description>AT&amp;amp;T 的约翰·斯坦基和摩根大通的杰米·戴蒙一致认为：会议应该值得每个人花时间，而且与会者不应该害怕提出不同意见。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2237948526-e1788540915253.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 10:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/att-ceo-john-stankey-meeting-etiquette-show-up-prepared-crave-productivity-like-jpmorgan-ceo-jamie-dimon/</guid></item><item><title>在航空航天领域工作了 30 年后，这些兄弟从迪士尼的企业生活和工作中退休：“我不再与笔记本电脑和手机结婚了”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/after-30-years-aerospace-brothers-retired-corporate-life-work-at-disney-finished-being-married-laptop-phone/</link><description>Jerry 和 Peter Wong 从小到大每年都会去迪士尼。现在他们已经 60 多岁了，在加州主题公园担任摄影师和游乐设施工作人员。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/JerryPeterWong-e1788549874221.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/after-30-years-aerospace-brothers-retired-corporate-life-work-at-disney-finished-being-married-laptop-phone/</guid></item><item><title>数十年来，餐厅一直在提供虚假食品广告——AI slop只是最新的特色菜</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/ai-food-slop-restaurant-ads-menus/</link><description>生成式人工智能为餐厅提供了食物摄影的廉价替代方案，但顾客可能更喜欢实际存在的不完美的餐点照片。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2267818728-e1788551435937.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/ai-food-slop-restaurant-ads-menus/</guid></item><item><title>认识一下波特兰火焰队的老板，他们家族的泳装公司和昙花一现的 NFL 合资企业为价值 3.8 亿美元的 WNBA 特许经营权奠定了基础</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/portland-fire-wnba-owners-alex-lisa-bhathal-merage-raj-sports/</link><description>“我们知道事情需要时间。但我们也知道我们会让一些人感到惊讶，我认为我们已经做到了，”亚历克斯·巴塔尔告诉《财富》杂志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2293069516-e1788558986137.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/06/portland-fire-wnba-owners-alex-lisa-bhathal-merage-raj-sports/</guid></item><item><title>东盟仍然可以在人工智能方面对冲美国和中国。它需要首先采取行动</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/asean-can-still-hedge-between-america-and-china-on-ai-it-needs-to-get-its-act-together-first/</link><description>东盟成员国能否借鉴中国和西方的生态系统来追求自身利益？ &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2289751021-e1788590449688.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/asean-can-still-hedge-between-america-and-china-on-ai-it-needs-to-get-its-act-together-first/</guid></item><item><title>“把它扔进火里。”法国总统竞选中的领先候选人对巨额国债有一个简单的解决方案：取消债务</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/france-national-debt-cancelation-presidential-candidate-jean-luc-melenchon-central-bank-french-german-bond-yields/</link><description>“为什么我们要一起制定单一货币和欧洲央行？我们可以做到，而且我打赌我们会在欧洲找到盟友。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1243090542-e1788630126687.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 19:07:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/france-national-debt-cancelation-presidential-candidate-jean-luc-melenchon-central-bank-french-german-bond-yields/</guid></item><item><title>来认识一下这位由嘉年华表演者转型为歌剧演员的人，他负责为莫扎特的改编作品试镜蛇。 “我们将与公主一起前进”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/metropolitan-opera-snake-handler-animal-auditions-mozart/</link><description>几乎纽约大都会歌剧院舞台上的每个人都必须试镜，甚至是在即将上映的莫扎特经典改编作品中短暂占据舞台中央的那条蛇。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26244696262623-e1788647125438.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 22:32:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/metropolitan-opera-snake-handler-animal-auditions-mozart/</guid></item><item><title>这些行业将在未来十年引领招聘，仅一个行业就占所有新增就业岗位的三分之一以上</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/05/top-industries-hiring-next-decade-ai-utilities-healthcare-jobs/</link><description>医疗保健和社会救助行业将在未来十年增加220万就业机会。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-a